In IRC most discussions fall back to English due to three reasons:
1. Newbies come and ask questions on Lojban
2. Computer terminology doesn't exist not only in Lojban but even e.g. in
Russian (for the most part ofc., Russian of course has words for "computer"
and other ordinary concepts borrowed from English again).
3. People don't discuss Lojban-related things (this is discouraged in
#lojban channel but nevertheless spontaneously happens sometimes)



